# TokenPilot bench-hook.mjs -- own latency benchmark, n=30
# Before ast-index install:
bench-hook  n=30  cold=1404.1ms  warm p50=1086.9ms  p95=1137.8ms  p99=1166.9ms
thresholds  warm p50<30  warm p95<100  cold p99<250
BREACH: warm p50 1086.9 >= 30 | warm p95 1137.8 >= 100 | cold 1404.1 >= 250

# After `npm install -g @ast-index/cli` (tool's own documented fallback):
bench-hook  n=30  cold=958.2ms  warm p50=1035.5ms  p95=1452.8ms  p99=1494.5ms
thresholds  warm p50<30  warm p95<100  cold p99<250
BREACH: warm p50 1035.5 >= 30 | warm p95 1452.8 >= 100 | cold 958.2 >= 250
# Root cause: per-call Node process spawn overhead (architectural), not the missing binary.

